OL,3,AWW2 sailor and SBS member dies aged 101
OL,4,
OL,5,FOne of the West of England's last
OL,6,Fsurviving veterans from World War Two
OL,7,Fhas passed away aged 101.
OL,9,FHarry Francis, from South
OL,10,FGloucestershire, joined the Royal Navy
OL,11,Fin 1942 at 16, having lied about his
OL,12,Fage to serve.
OL,14,FHe went on to join the Royal Marines
OL,15,Fand became one of the first men to join
OL,16,Fthe Special Boat Service (SBS),
OL,17,Fcarrying out covert operations in
OL,18,FItaly, Lebanon and Burma, where he was
OL,19,Fwounded.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
