OL,3,AWW2 sailor and SBS member dies aged 101
OL,4,
OL,5,FSouth Gloucestershire Armed Forces Day
OL,6,Fput out a tribute on social media where
OL,7,Forganisers said: "His quiet bravery and
OL,8,Fhis remarkable life will not be
OL,9,Fforgotten."
